  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM kurs Makerere univ. Uganda 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM workshop at Makerere Univ. Uganda 2014 - RBM Makerere May 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Insatsen inneb&#xe4;r en utbildning av Makerereuniversitetets personal i &apos;Results Based Management&apos;. Kursen inneh&#xe5;ller &#xe4;ven uppgiften att identifiera indikatorer i skrivna projektf&#xf6;rslag inf&#xf6;r ett ev. nytt avtal om forskningssamarbete med Uganda 2015-2020. Utbildningen &#xe4;r en del av en l&#xe5;ngtidssatsning f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka kunskap om planering och uppf&#xf6;ljning av verksamheten inom ramverket RBM.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is a call-off contract through Sida&apos;s framework agreement with AIMS Inc. to conduct a Results Based Management workshop with staff from Makerere University, Uganda. The workshop is specifically geared toward identifying performance indicators for projects for the planned new research cooperation agreement with Uganda 2015-2020.</narrative>
  </description>
